[1m[38;5;231m60-second coalescing window — right default?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153m60 seconds (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mCatches the common burst-of-edits case; notification still feels prompt. Configurable constant.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Shorter (~10s)
     [38;5;246mNotifications feel near-real-time; catches only very rapid double-saves.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Longer (~5 min)
     [38;5;246mMuch stronger batching; notifications lag noticeably behind the change.[39m
